CeladonCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_PokeFluteAwakensSleepingMons::
    .string "A Poke Flute\n"
    .string "can awaken sleeping Pokemon.\p"
    .string "Someone played it\n"
    .string "near the east\n"
    .string "wall last night.\p"
    .string "ProtoGlyph didn't wake.\p"
    .string "It wasn't asleep.$"

CeladonCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_RodeHereFromFuchsia::
    .string "I rode here\n"
    .string "from Fuchsia.\n"
    .string "Completely exhausted.\p"
    .string "The road through\n"
    .string "the forest was\n"
    .string "different this time.\p"
    .string "Larger marks on\n"
    .string "the path.\n"
    .string "Deeper than before.\p"
    .string "ProtoGlyph takes the\n"
    .string "forest road now.$"

CeladonCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_GoToCyclingRoadIfIHadBike::
    .string "You need a\n"
    .string "Bike for Cycling Road.\p"
    .string "Something on Cycling\n"
    .string "Road doesn't use\n"
    .string "the road.\n"
    .string "It uses the\n"
    .string "ground under it.\p"
    .string "Cyclists reported vibrations\n"
    .string "last week.\p"
    .string "ProtoGlyph.$"

